**Highest-priority concern —** a 4,500-word profile of a comedian that never shows his comedy. No bit, no premise, no described routine. The piece stages a critics-versus-audience dispute about his material and never lets the reader see the material, so the A− CinemaScore stays an abstraction. I left able to explain why he hides and unable to say why anyone bought a ticket.

